PRINTL ──── 经验设定（[编号] 进入输入数值，[0] 清零该项）────
PRINTFORML [1] Ｃ经验　{EXP:MASTER:0}
PRINTFORML [2] Ｖ经验　{EXP:MASTER:1}
PRINTFORML [3] Ａ经验　{EXP:MASTER:2}
